; WHO 4 thermoregulation: the DIMENSION 13 request forms a gateway forwards to the bus: WHERE N
; and #N, bare, with the #1 suffix and with the interface suffix #4#01.
; Boundary probe of 2026-11-16 and 2026-11-17 on the 13 emulated gateways, asked for MyHOME
; (local offset / knob reads): the same N (0, 1, 101) in all six forms.
;
; Result (stock settings, two identical runs per target, 13 targets): per group below, the
; gateways that forward the frame to the bus or answer it on the event session, and the
; gateways whose daemon crashes. Gateways not named drop the frame.

; 1. *#4*N*13##
;    forwarded by F453, F453AV, MH200N
down *#4*0*13##
;    forwarded by all 13
down *#4*1*13##
;    forwarded by MH202
down *#4*101*13##

; 2. *#4*#N*13##
;    forwarded by F453, F453AV, MH200N
down *#4*#0*13##
;    forwarded by F453, F453AV, MH200N, MH202
down *#4*#1*13##
;    dropped by every gateway
down *#4*#101*13##

; 3. *#4*N#1*13##
;    dropped by every gateway
down *#4*0#1*13##
down *#4*101#1*13##
;    forwarded by H4684, MH200
down *#4*1#1*13##

; 4. *#4*#N#1*13##
;    dropped by every gateway
down *#4*#0#1*13##
down *#4*#101#1*13##
;    forwarded by MH202
down *#4*#1#1*13##

; 5. *#4*N#4#01*13##
;    dropped by every gateway
down *#4*0#4#01*13##
down *#4*101#4#01*13##
;    forwarded by H4684, MH200
down *#4*1#4#01*13##

; 6. *#4*#N#4#01*13##
;    dropped by every gateway
down *#4*#0#4#01*13##
down *#4*#101#4#01*13##
;    forwarded by MH202
down *#4*#1#4#01*13##
